    "body": "> However, https://jsfiddle.net/hyzLu4nk/1/ doesn't throw in Chrome dev edition. \r\n\r\nGiven https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/9142#issuecomment-1538596372, it seems to make sense to specify that. @josepharhar WDYT?\r\n@nt1m would you support specifying this?\r\n\r\nLocally I've a WPT for that scenario which I'd request to pull once the above questions are clarified. ",
